{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Makkah like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Last Pillar, you work behind the scenes in Makkah serving those who have come for Hajj.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time you are drawn closer to your own dream of completing Hajj, and eventually walk the pilgrimage yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respectfully crafted learning, designed to honor the sacred journey of Hajj. Discover the rituals, history, and significance of Hajj in an engaging and respectful way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the grandeur of: the Kaaba, Safa Marwa, ZamZam well, clock tower, mountains of Makkah, and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique narrative journey. A story of faith, hope, and sacrifice. From waiting and longing to finally completing Hajj yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: This journey is not Hajj itself, but a window into its beauty. It is an experience designed to guide your heart, to awaken your spirit, and to give you a glimpse of the awe that awaits when you embark on the true pilgrimage yourself.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3985690?t=1756479214","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985690/a554fada42e235e6b61d253f64a8931823f869e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756479214","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985690/66aad64397ce7cc9a29e058f7744426486ba43df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756479214","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985690/66aad64397ce7cc9a29e058f7744426486ba43df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756479214","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Makkah like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Last Pillar, you work behind the scenes in Makkah serving those who have come for Hajj.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time you are drawn closer to your own dream of completing Hajj, and eventually walk the pilgrimage yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respectfully crafted learning, designed to honor the sacred journey of Hajj. Discover the rituals, history, and significance of Hajj in an engaging and respectful way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the grandeur of: the Kaaba, Safa Marwa, ZamZam well, clock tower, mountains of Makkah, and beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique narrative journey. A story of faith, hope, and sacrifice. From waiting and longing to finally completing Hajj yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Disclaimer: This journey is not Hajj itself, but a window into its beauty. It is an experience designed to guide your heart, to awaken your spirit, and to give you a glimpse of the awe that awaits when you embark on the true pilgrimage yourself.</i></p>","developers":["Crescent Dial Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985690/1e989aac39aaa3b7a112b2a9eaed1bcd8c519995/header.jpg?t=1756479214","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"da